      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i'm mostly worried about the \"unseen\" stuff though—like those weird rules you don't find on the main travel sites, the things that cause people to get pulled aside for questioning even if they have their papers in order. are there specific red flags or small technicalities in the paperwork that usually trigger a border agent to get suspicious or cause delays?",
